[2.631, "o", "       171  open violations at those buildings since 2021-09-14\r\n            by type: {\"C\": 8, \"E\": 12, \"EARCX\": 1, \"FISPHAZ\": 1, \"FISPNRF\": 11, \"HBLVIO\": 4, \"LBLVIO\": 130, \"P\": 1, \"RWNRF\": 3}\r\n\r\n            This violation count is deliberately wider than the one a pass reports.\r\n            It is every open violation at every building the contractor has a permit\r\n            in, over five years. A pass narrows it twice before deciding anything:\r\n            to two years, and to the buildings where a live permit still sits\r\n            (agent/engine/portfolio.py, VIOLATION_SINCE_DAYS and live_bins). The wide\r\n            number is the raw exposure. The narrow one is what is actually theirs.\r\n"]
